<title>USA: Centigram Communications sets shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Centigram Communications sets shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centigram Communications Corp said on Tuesday its board approved the repurchase of up to one million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Repurchases would be made from time to time on the open market, the company said.</p>
<p>Centigram provides wireless and wireline messaging and communications solutions.</p>
<p>(New York newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
